    scripture_primary_text: "Yahweh is good to those who wait for him, to the soul that seeks him. It is good that a man should hope and quietly wait for the salvation of Yahweh... Let the favor of the Lord our God be on us; establish the work of our hands for us; yes, establish the work of our hands.",
