    scripture_primary_reference: "1 John 4:19-21",
    scripture_primary_text: "We love him, because he first loved us. If a man says, 'I love God,' and hates his brother, he is a liar; for he who doesn\u2019t love his brother whom he has seen, how can he love God whom he has not seen? This commandment we have from him, that he who loves God should also love his brother.",
